      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Believe they need it to do some checks for existing DB hand/feet colliders and to generate the new avatar descriptor defined colliders. It’ll error if you have no Animator on your avatar when you have a descriptor.\nIt would be incredibly useful if the “No Avatars Found” warning had a Try Anyways button (or something similar), which would skip any hand collider removal and auto collider generation that it normally does.\nI’ve been adding avatar descriptors and animator components to my prefabs root when converting, which is really annoying.",
