  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-04-18T12:37:15.213Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently you can’t use the auto conversion tool (VRChat SDK > Utilities > Convert DynamicBones to PhysBones) on an object that doesn’t have an Avatar Descriptor. You will get the error message that the tool couldn’t find any Avatars.\nI think that tool should be changed so it no longer requires an Avatar Descriptor, it would be practical if you only want to convert a section of your Avatar or just a single bone instead of the whole Avatar all at once.",
